  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FF - UNESCAP Risk &amp; Coastal Resilience Portal (IDD) and Enabling Urban Action to Enhance Climate Resilience (EDD)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Two projects implemented by ESCAP under the CARA Flexible Fund: 1. Risk and Resilience Portal: Multi-hazard Coastal Analysis and Adaptation that will develop a digital tool that identifies, maps and quantifies multi-hazard coastal risk, exposure and vulnerability hotspots in Asia and the Pacific to support planning, preparedness and adaptation efforts for coastal communities, and 2. Enabling Urban Action to Enhance Climate Resilience in Asia, that will enhance urban resilience in South and Southeast Asia by developing and implementing effective emergency response systems and long-term  sustainable heat resilience strategies, with priority focus on nature-based solutions, in response to the heightened need to mitigate the impacts of extreme heat in key urban centres.</narrative>
  </description>
